: "quiet reading" of Playboy by a firefighter supports this view. But
: someone may have to go to court, or at least make serious motions toward
: doing so, before U. of Houston changes its policy.

Yes to the first part, but a tentative "let's see" to the second.  As 
long as they're represented here, talking ...  

